  "title": "Grilled Maple-Chipotle Bacon",
  "description": "Cooking bacon on the grill yields a wonderful charred flavor. Add to that the sweet-heat kick of maple and chipotle and you've got yourself quite the breakfast treat.",
  "authors": [
    "France Cevallos"
  ],
